      },
      "message": "feat: add Sstvecv extension definition\n\nAdd the Sstvecv (Vectored exception handling) extension definition.\n\nSstvecv indicates that the stvec.MODE field can hold the value 1\n(Vectored), enabling vectored interrupt handling where each interrupt\nsource has its own entry point at stvec.BASE + 4 * cause.\n\nThis is the companion to the existing Sstvecd extension which covers\nDirect mode (MODE=0). The extension requires the STVEC_MODE_VECTORED\nparameter to be true.\n\nCloses #1201",
